    "body": "Right, I think the model as-is doesn't work for certain use cases and this wasn't flagged when the model was designed. As such we need to make changes to better account for what SW, IDB, and WL need.\r\n\r\nI suspect it's not as simple as exporting the terms unfortunately.",
